tions Mention, Embed, Bookmark. Mention insere un lien inline, Embed insere un embed provider-safe, Bookmark insere une carte unfurl. Ne pas coder d'autre feature.\n"}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA docs/notion-link-paste/plan.md\n"},"completed_at_ms":1780253980344}}
